  "publishedAt": null,
  "contentHtml": "<figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!w6Is!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5de5d442-0449-4f37-a82b-7e09457b3074_2756x748.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n<img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!w6Is!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5de5d442-0449-4f37-a82b-7e09457b3074_2756x748.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"395\" data-size=\"normal\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n\n\n</a></figure>\n<p>In this space on Saturdays, I <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/t/roundup\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">do a weekly round-up</a> of sorts: Sifting through what I wrote that you might have missed during the week, what I’ve been reading and watching myself, and some other fun things that have been going on.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/subscribe?\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h4>📝 What I did this week</h4>\n<p><em>Here are the things I wrote or podcasted about during the previous week, sorted in descending order by quality, popularity and/or current relevance.</em></p>\n<p><strong>📊 My <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/t/updating-model\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Odds/Models</a>: <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-nfl-odds-tracker-and-elo-ratings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NFL </a></strong>| <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-mlb-elo-power-ratings-playoff\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">MLB </a></strong>| <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-wnba-elo-team-power-rankings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">WNBA </a></strong>| <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-27-nba-elo-forecast-and-player\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NBA</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-27-nhl-team-elo-power-rankings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NHL </a></strong>| <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-college-football-odds-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CFB</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-27-english-premier-league-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">EPL</a> | <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-nascar-cup-series-driver-rankings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NASCAR</a></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>Check out the <strong><a href=\"https://yahoosports.com/am?.tsrc=1317&amp;ncid=crm_-2348335-20261009-1--A&amp;utm_content=mktg_1317_di_-2348335-20261009-1--A&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=email&amp;bt_user_id=SrjGgvZlBf5qIZUVu7yYI1CqlkUyD55KDXbV%2BKpd15uedTV17eKJtcMAhxssnZ11ayDylgxSDVgRNS4WgjqkPZPBV36yuhe3WjW0KlumYYM0G8xcJYj%2F85w0Ks9Zo1at&amp;bt_ts=1791548043236\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Yahoo! Sports AM newsletter</a></strong> for my various charts and other contributions!</p></li>\n<li><p>⚾ <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/the-dodgers-broke-our-baseball-brains\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Dodgers Broke Our Baseball Brains</a></strong> - Following Los Angeles’ shocking NLCS sweep at the hands of the Milwaukee Brewers, I unpacked what three years of “Dodger Derangement Syndrome” did to our collective understanding of baseball — including the relative influence of payroll dominance versus randomness in October.</p></li>\n<li><p>⚾ <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/is-this-the-october-of-small-ball\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Is This the October of Small Ball? It’s Complicated.</a></strong> - As teams like the Tampa Bay Rays and Milwaukee Brewers rely on bunts and other means of manufacturing runs, I looked at the numbers behind the postseason’s “small ball” narrative to see if old-school strategy is actually driving playoff success… or just a fun story.</p></li>\n<li><p>🏈 <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/before-tom-brady-was-great-he-was\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Before Tom Brady Was Great, He Was Good Enough To Win With</a></strong> - Twenty-five years after his first NFL touchdown pass, I looked back at how Tom Brady helped lead the 2001 New England Patriots to a championship — not by instantly playing like the GOAT he would later become, but by raising a good team’s floor at baseline.</p></li>\n<li><p>🏀 <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/neither-won-the-nba-title-now-theyre\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Neither Won the NBA Title. Now They’re Historic Co-Favorites.</a></strong> - Heading into the 2026-27 NBA season, I looked at why <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/i/216453179/2026-27-nba-team-aggregated-market-forecast\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">my market-projection aggregator</a> has the Oklahoma City Thunder and San Antonio Spurs locked in a historic co-favorite dead-heat, far ahead of the rest of the league — despite neither team, uh, you know, winning last year’s title.</p></li>\n<li><p>🏀 <strong><a href=\"https://www.espn.com/wnba/story/_/id/50162878/wnba-finals-2026-golden-state-valkyries-expansion-team\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Valkyries’ Wild Path From Expansion Team to the Finals</a></strong> - Going into the WNBA Finals matchup against Atlanta, I broke down how the Golden State Valkyries pulled off a historic postseason run to reach the championship series in just their second year as an expansion franchise.</p></li>\n<li><p>🏈 <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/bills-rams-could-show-us-one-super\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Bills-Rams Could Show Us One Super Bowl Team. But Maybe Not Two.</a></strong> - Ahead of the marquee Monday Night Football clash between two Super Bowl LXI contenders, I dug into why premier inter-conference games frequently feature <em>one</em> eventual Super Bowl squad — but almost never accurately predict the exact February matchup.</p></li>\n<li>\n<p>🏁 <strong><a href=\"https://www.nascar.com/news-media/2026/10/15/analysis-chase-briscoe-keeps-winning-and-doing-kyle-larson-a-huge-favor/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Are Chase Briscoe’s Wins Helping Kyle Larson?</a></strong> - At  this week, I analyzed how Chase Briscoe’s playoff victory streak is inadvertently doing points leader Kyle Larson a massive favor in his championship chase, by denying high-scoring wins to other contenders.</p>\n<ul><li><p>🏁🎙️ <strong><a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/episode/4Ib5CCMENA2rToWZLnaY9A?si=eJCfzu5vT0CTliJqJ_QzyA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Podracing: Thanks, Briscoe!</a></strong> - In this week’s , <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/tyler-lauletta-b0399667/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> Lauletta</a> and I broke down Briscoe’s second consecutive victory — big for us, as a deeply pro-Briscoe podcast — and we dove into my story on why that might actually be good news for Larson as well. Finally, we look ahead to Phoenix, where being a “Phoenix Merchant” thankfully means a little less this year.</p></li></ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>📊 Charts of the week:</h4>\n<p>Here were some of my favorite viz items of the week from <em><strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/scoreboard-newsletter-archives\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Scoreboard</a></strong></em>, my daily newsletter for <a href=\"https://sherwood.news/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Sherwood News</a>… </p>\n<p><strong>⚾</strong><em><strong> On the <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/how-sweep-it-is\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">most unlikely MLB sweeps</a>…</strong></em></p>\n<div class=\"reader-datawrapper\"><a href=\"https://datawrapper.dwcdn.net/G7svp/1/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/626661de-321b-42c7-bdb8-ea6250434466_1220x912.png\" alt=\"The sweeps we never saw coming\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><p>The sweeps we never saw coming</p></div>\n<p>🏈<strong> </strong><em><strong>On the Broncos’ <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/how-sweep-it-is\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">moribund (yet winning) offense</a>…</strong></em></p>\n<div class=\"reader-datawrapper\"><a href=\"https://datawrapper.dwcdn.net/DcMfP/1/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/1d11da99-6f4e-460d-b5af-659d72013055_1220x766.png\" alt=\"Who needs offense?\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><p>Who needs offense?</p></div>\n<p>⚽<strong> </strong><em><strong>On the Champions League <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/on-the-brink\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">forgetting how to play defense</a>…</strong></em></p>\n<div></div>\n<p><strong>🏈</strong><em><strong> On Josh Allen’s <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/trouble-brewing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">greatest rushing efforts</a>…</strong></em></p>\n<p><em>Subscribe to <strong>Scoreboard</strong> by <strong><a href=\"https://join.sherwood.news/scoreboard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">clicking here</a></strong>!</em></p>\n<h4>👀 Some interesting things I read/watched this week</h4>\n<p><em>A collection of articles (with a heavy focus on my fellow Substackers), videos and other media that I enjoyed and/or found thought-provoking over the past week. I don’t always 100% agree with or endorse what’s linked here… but that’s also sort of the point.</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li><p><strong>🏈 <a href=\"https://frontporchsports.subs