errer\">“</a><strong><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cAetw18q3sI\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Social Media Would’ve HATED Peyton Manning”</a> </strong>by <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@CamWoolleySports\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Cameron Woolley</a></p></li>\n<li><p>🏈<strong>▶️ </strong><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0g6wbnQvjoA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“</a><strong><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0g6wbnQvjoA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The NFL Was Wrong About Quarterbacks”</a></strong> by  and <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@BrettKollmann\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Brett Kollmann</a></p></li>\n<li><p><strong>⚾ <a href=\"https://throwbacks.substack.com/p/farewell-hopefully-to-the-dodgers?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=31587&amp;post_id=220561282&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=false&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“Farewell to the Dodgers, the Defining Team of a Broken Age”</a> </strong>by  </p></li>\n<li><p><strong>⚾ <a href=\"https://baseballreplayjournal.substack.com/p/the-playoffs-and-parity?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=1265175&amp;post_id=220501830&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“The Playoffs And Parity”</a> </strong>by  </p></li>\n<li><p><strong>⚾ <a href=\"https://ritmica1.substack.com/p/how-small-ball-are-the-four-cs-teams?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=5688290&amp;post_id=220438885&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“How “Small Ball” Are the Four CS Teams, Really?”</a> </strong>by  </p></li>\n<li><p><strong>⚾ <a href=\"https://www.nytimes.c